/// Which transistor a [TransistorPainter] draws: the same TO-92 body, labelled
/// for its type and pin order.
enum TransistorKind() {
  npn,
  pnp,
  nmos,
  pmos,
}

/// Draws a transistor in a TO-92 package, flat face forward, standing on its
/// three legs — the body of the `transistor_*.pdl` parts, which name it with
/// `PAINTER transistor_<kind>` and declare everything else: pins and physics.
///
/// The artwork is vector paths generated by the Flutter Da Vinci Figma plugin
/// from the "Transistor NPN/PNP/NMOS/PMOS" frames in the *PinBench Parts*
/// Figma file — one layer per colour, each shifted to where that layer sits in
/// the frame. The body is shared; only the two label layers differ by [kind].
/// Redraw them there and regenerate rather than hand-editing the coordinates.
